then make x² the subject.","steps":"1. Rule (intercepts): for the y-intercept put x = 0; for the x-intercept put y = 0.<br>2. −3x² + 12 = 0<br>3. 3x² = 12, so x² = 4<br>4. Rule: if x² = k (k &gt; 0), then x = ±√k.<br>5. x = 2 or x = −2"}]}